- QUOTED_FIELD
- QUOTE_IN_QUOTED_FIELD (saw a quote inside a quoted field; either escaped quote or field end)
- RECORD_END

Transitions on characters: delimiter, quotechar, newline (\n), carriage return (\r), and "other".

